    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "brxedge",
      "content": "Agronomy is the science and technology of producing and using plants for food, fuel, fibre, and land reclamation. It encompasses the study of crop plants, their growth environments, and management practices to optimise yield, quality, and sustainability."
    },
