    {
      "id": "lw91u8v",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "2.5 Seed Technology"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "nd7fx5s",
      "content": "Seed is the basic input in agriculture. Seed quality directly determines crop yield, uniformity, and response to other inputs. Seed technology encompasses all aspects of seed production, processing, certification, storage, and distribution."
    },
    {
      "id": "tu8ufrn",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Seed Classes"
    },
    {
      "id": "yu6ozer",
