    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Scientific names of major crops (Oryza sativa, Triticum aestivum, Zea mays, Saccharum officinarum) are heavily tested in agricultural competitive exams.",
        "Identification of critical irrigation stages for major crops is a recurring question topic.",
        "Questions frequently test the hierarchy of seed classes and standards for seed quality parameters."
      ],
